# topbar namespace manifest (docs/USERSPACE_v2.md UP4).
# The menu bar draws from the UI runtime (fonts + libembk.so + images) under the
# sealed, read-only /system, and owns a window (a GPU capability, not a name).
# Its ONE piece of IPC: it connects to the desktop's channel in /run to ask it to
# open the Apps launcher (the launcher renders on the desktop so apps can be
# dragged into the dock). So: read /system, reach /run -- nothing else nameable.
ro /system
rw /run
